kness / Width / Length</dt><dd>0.7/0.8 mm × 4 mm; length 45–55 cm</dd></div><div><dt>Ingredients</dt><dd>Durum wheat semolina, eggs 30.3%, sage 2.3%</dd></div><div><dt>Manufacturing</dt><dd>Rough and porous, dried slowly</dd></div><div><dt>Producer</dt><dd>Marcozzi di Campofilone</dd></div></dl></section><section class="lux-reader-section lux-product-story-media"><h2>Product Information</h2><p>Egg fettuccine with 2.3% sage, offering a distinctive herbal aroma. Made with durum wheat semolina and eggs and slowly dried at low temperature.</p><p>Sage fettuccine works with butter, pumpkin, cream and roast poultry. Browned butter and a simple finish are enough to show its herbal character.</p><div class="lux-product-videos" aria-label="Product videos"><video data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/pasta/sage-fettuccine.webp'); ?>" aria-label="Sage Fettuccine · 250 g video 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/20397141.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/pasta/sage-fettuccine.webp'); ?>" aria-label="Sage Fettuccine · 250 g video 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/37919129.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="lux-product-video-notes"><p>Ribbon pasta is best finished in the pan rather than covered with sauce at the table. Let the pasta and sauce come together so the texture feels more connected with each bite.</p></div><div class="lux-product-storage-gallery"><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/pasta-01-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loadi